          ('Who was waiting at the corner?', 'A bent figure in a thin shawl – an old person', ['A policeman', 'A teacher', 'A shopkeeper']),
          ('What did most of the boys do?', 'They raced past the corner without stopping.'),
          ('What do you think the boy who turned around will do next?', 'He will go back to help the old person.', None),
